                    Les Destinations<br/>
                    <span style="color: #c9a84c;">les plus Exclusives</span><br/>
                    du Monde
                </h1>
                <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; line-height: 1.8;">
                    Yacht ou jet privé - choisissez votre destination de rêve
                    et laissez-nous orchestrer chaque détail de votre voyage.
                </p>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <a href="#destinations"
                       style="background: #c9a84c; color: #000; padding: 1rem 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 2px; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                        <i class="fa fa-compass me-2"/>
                        Découvrir
                    </a>
                    <a href="/shop"
                       style="border: 2px solid #fff; color: #fff; padding: 1rem 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 2px; font-size: 1rem;">
                        <i class="fa fa-ship me-2"/>
                        Réserver
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Scroll indicator -->
            <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 2rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); text-align: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                <i class="fa fa-chevron-down fa-2x" style="animation: bounce 2s infinite;"/>
            </div>
        </section>

        <style>
            @keyframes bounce {
                0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
                50% { transform: translateY(8px); }
            }
            .dest-card { position: relative; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; }
            .dest-card img { transition: transform 0.6s ease; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
            .dest-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.08); }
            .dest-card .overlay { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 0%, transparent 100%); padding: 2rem 1.5rem 1.5rem; transition: all 0.3s; }
            .dest-card .hover-content { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); transition: all 0.3s; }
            .dest-card:hover .hover-content { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
            .region-btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid #c9a84c; color: #c9a84c; padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 2px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.85rem; transition: all 0.2s; }
            .region-btn:hover, .region-btn.active { background: #c9a84c; color: #000; font-weight: 600; }
            .dest-badge { display: inline-block; background: #c9a84c; color: #000; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
